## 6. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely cause | Check |
|---|---|---|
| Policy rejected by webhook | `isRdma: true` with `deviceType: vfio-pci`, or VF range overlap / `numVfs` mismatch | Policy YAML against existing policies on the same PF |
| Node resource `rdma_sriov_net` = 0 | Policy did not sync, or `irdma` not loaded | `oc get sriovnetworknodestates`, `lsmod | grep irdma` on node |
| Pod stuck `Pending` | Resource name typo, or no free VFs on any node | `oc describe pod`, `oc describe nodes | grep rdma` |
| `ibv_devinfo` shows no device | `/dev/infiniband` not injected (wrong rdmaMode state) or policy not RDMA | `ls /dev/infiniband` in pod, confirm `isRdma: true` |
| `ibv_reg_mr` / memory registration fails | Missing `IPC_LOCK` | Pod `securityContext.capabilities` |
| `ib_write_bw` hangs at connection | UDP 4791 blocked, wrong GID index, VLAN missing on trunk | `show_gids`, `ping` over RDMA interface, switch VLAN config |
| Good single-stream bandwidth, poor multi-stream | PFC/ECN not configured | Switch QoS configuration, `ethtool -S ens1f2 | grep -i pause` |
| Port state `PORT_DOWN` | PF link down or VLAN / link admin state | `ip link show ens1f2`, `SriovNetworkNodeState` link info |

